<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Sorcerer Skills</h1>
<p>The skills the Sorcerers' guild teaches, in its tower in Midgaard. Level is the guild level at which you can first practice the skill there, and Up to is the most you can learn it at the guild (see <a cmd='#'>Help Practice</a>).
</p>
<pre>Name                 Level   Up to
Armor Soft Leather       0   75%
Fleeing                  0   60%
Wand Use                 0   100%
Scroll Use               1   100%
Consider                 3   60%
Weather Watching        12   35%
</pre>
